{% comment %}
  Gradient product title for the buy box.

  A single heading whose text is painted with a left-to-right gradient rather
  than a flat colour. The two stops are block settings so the same section can
  carry a different accent per product without a new stylesheet.

  This is the alternative to the standard title block, not a companion to it —
  that one carries eyebrow, heading and subtext. Use one or the other, or the
  product's name prints twice.

  Falls back to the product title so the block still reads on a product that has
  no custom copy yet.

  Accepts:
  - block {Object} - the gradient_title block. Reads settings.title,
    .text_color and .highlight_color.
  - product {Object} - product used for the heading fallback.

  Usage:
  {% render 'CWC_pdp-gradient-title__block', block: block, product: hero_product %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign title_color = block.settings.text_color | default: '#2D2D2D'
  assign highlight_color = block.settings.highlight_color | default: '#45B5B7'
-%}

<div
  class="cwc_product-hero-buy-box__gradient-title cwc-rte"
  style="--gradient-title-color: {{ title_color }}; --gradient-title-highlight: {{ highlight_color }};"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>
  {%- if block.settings.title != blank -%}
    {{ block.settings.title }}
  {%- else -%}
    <p>{{ product.title | default: 'Product title' }}</p>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
